epts. Media QA results are attributes of Clip and are advisory (FR-38); STEM rule checks are recorded as StemValidationRun." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="1710" x="207" y="1150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-140" parent="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;b&gt;Seat gate (AT24):&lt;/b&gt; an action needs an active seat — Admin without an active REVIEWER seat cannot record a StemAssessment. The STEM gate (StemValidationRun) can block a submit but never approves on its own; only a Reviewer decision approves (FR-38 / BR-12)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="34" width="1710" x="207" y="1240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-141" parent="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="Actor (kept separate — not User + Role)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="280" x="247" y="1290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-142" parent="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="Content / pipeline entity" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="200" x="577" y="1290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-143" parent="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="STEM core entity (new)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="200" x="827" y="1290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-144" parent="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="Relationship (diamond) · crow's foot: | = one, &lt; = many, o = optional" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="380" x="1077" y="1290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-145" parent="nF05k804WYcVGkSJqCQT-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strok